%% Scope: Software system boundary; external integrations are candidates, not deployed facts.
%% Legend: Blue: system/person. Yellow: conditional external system. AI reads only; human mutations require capability.
flowchart LR
    Member["Person: Project member<br/>PO / developer / Scrum Master / viewer<br/>Capabilities and source read rights are separate"]
    System["Software system: Scrum Workspace + AI Project KMS<br/>Scrum work, immutable knowledge, scoped retrieval, exact citations and audit"]
    Gen["External software system: Generation provider<br/>Candidate cloud or local provider; not selected"]
    Embed["External software system: Embedding provider<br/>Candidate model/service; not selected"]
    Identity["External software system: Identity provider<br/>Only if external identity is selected; local identity remains an alternative"]
    Member -->|"Uses permitted work, knowledge and inspection"| System
    System -->|"Sends guarded permitted evidence; receives draft"| Gen
    System -->|"Embeds permitted text / query; receives vectors"| Embed
    System -->|"Conditional identity integration"| Identity
